@startuml SD_JWT_Authentication_Flow
!theme cerulean-outline

title JWT Authentication Lifecycle\nAdventureWorks Sales BI Platform

autonumber "<b>[0]"
hide footbox

skinparam maxMessageSize 160
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam sequenceGroupBodyBackgroundColor #FAFAFA80
skinparam sequenceDividerBackgroundColor #ECEFF1
skinparam sequenceDividerBorderColor #90A4AE
skinparam sequenceBoxBorderColor #90A4AE

skinparam actor {
    BackgroundColor White
    BorderColor #37474F
    FontColor #212121
}
skinparam boundary {
    BackgroundColor #BBDEFB
    BorderColor #1565C0
    FontColor #0D47A1
}
skinparam participant {
    BackgroundColor #E8EAF6
    BorderColor #3949AB
    FontColor #1A237E
}
skinparam control {
    BackgroundColor #C8E6C9
    BorderColor #2E7D32
    FontColor #1B5E20
}
skinparam database {
    BackgroundColor #F8BBD0
    BorderColor #AD1457
    FontColor #880E4F
}

box "Client Tier" #EBF5FB
    actor       "User"                                    as User
    boundary    "Browser / React\n(Login Page)"           as React
    participant "Axios\napiClient\n(Interceptor)"         as Axios
end box

box "Backend — Auth" #F1F8E9
    control     "AuthController"                          as AuthCtrl
    control     "JwtTokenService"                         as JWT
end box

box "Backend — Middleware" #FFFDE7
    control     "ASP.NET Core\nMiddleware Pipeline"       as Pipeline
    control     "Controller\n[Authorize]"                 as Controller
end box

box "Data Layer" #FFF3E0
    database    "OltpDbContext\n(SQL Server)"              as DB
end box

== Phase 1: Token Creation (Login) ==

User -> React : Submits username + password
React -> Axios : AuthService.login({ username, password })
Axios -> AuthCtrl : **POST /api/auth/login**\n[AllowAnonymous]

AuthCtrl -> DB : UserManager.FindByNameAsync(username)
DB --> AuthCtrl : AppUser
AuthCtrl -> DB : SignInManager.CheckPasswordSignInAsync(\n  user, password, lockoutOnFailure: false)
DB --> AuthCtrl : Succeeded = true

AuthCtrl -> JWT : CreateTokenAsync(user)

JWT -> DB : UserManager.GetRolesAsync(user)
DB --> JWT : roles = ["Admin"]

JWT -> JWT : **Build Claims:**\n  ClaimTypes.NameIdentifier = userId\n  ClaimTypes.Name = username\n  JwtRegisteredClaimNames.Sub = userId\n  JwtRegisteredClaimNames.Email = email\n  "uid" = userId, "uname" = username\n  ClaimTypes.Role = "Admin"

JWT -> JWT : **Sign Token:**\n  Key: SymmetricSecurityKey(Jwt:Key)\n  Algorithm: HmacSha256\n  Issuer: Jwt:Issuer, Audience: Jwt:Audience\n  Expires: UtcNow + ExpiresMinutes

JWT --> AuthCtrl : (tokenString, expiresAtUtc, roles)
AuthCtrl --> Axios : **200 OK**\nAuthResponseDto {\n  token, expiresAtUtc,\n  username, email, roles\n}

== Phase 2: Token Storage (Client) ==

Axios --> React : response.data
React -> React : AuthContext.login(token, isAdmin, username)

group localStorage Persistence
    React -> React : localStorage.setItem(**"token"**, jwt_string)
    React -> React : localStorage.setItem(**"role"**, "Admin")
    React -> React : localStorage.setItem(**"username"**, username)
end

React -> React : Update AuthContext state:\n  isLoggedIn = true, isAdmin = true

== Phase 3: Authenticated API Requests ==

User -> React : Navigates to protected page\n(e.g. /orders, /dashboard)
React -> Axios : API call (e.g. GET /api/orders/mine)

Axios -> Axios : **Request Interceptor fires:**\nconst token = localStorage.getItem("token")\nif (token)\n  config.headers.Authorization = `Bearer ${token}`

Axios -> Pipeline : **GET /api/orders/mine**\nHeaders: Authorization: Bearer eyJhbG...

== Phase 4: Server-Side Token Validation ==

Pipeline -> Pipeline : **1. UseAuthentication()**\nJwtBearerAuthentication middleware

Pipeline -> Pipeline : **TokenValidationParameters:**\n  ValidateIssuer = true (Jwt:Issuer)\n  ValidateAudience = true (Jwt:Audience)\n  ValidateIssuerSigningKey = true\n  ValidateLifetime = true\n  ClockSkew = 15 seconds

alt Token validation fails (bad signature / wrong issuer)
    Pipeline --> Axios : **401 Unauthorized**\nWWW-Authenticate: Bearer error="invalid_token"
else Token expired
    Pipeline -> Pipeline : ValidateLifetime check:\ntoken.exp < UtcNow - ClockSkew
    Pipeline --> Axios : **401 Unauthorized**\nWWW-Authenticate: Bearer error="invalid_token",\n  error_description="token expired"
else Token valid
    Pipeline -> Pipeline : Deserialize claims from token payload
    Pipeline -> Pipeline : Build ClaimsPrincipal from token claims
    Pipeline -> Pipeline : HttpContext.User = ClaimsPrincipal

    Pipeline -> Pipeline : **2. UseAuthorization()**\nAuthorization middleware

    Pipeline -> Controller : Route to controller action

    Controller -> Controller : **[Authorize] attribute check:**\nIs HttpContext.User.Identity.IsAuthenticated?

    opt Role-based authorization
        Controller -> Controller : **[Authorize(Roles="Admin")]**\nCheck: User.IsInRole("Admin")\n=> ClaimTypes.Role contains "Admin"

        alt Role not present
            Controller --> Axios : **403 Forbidden**
            note right of Controller
                ConfigureApplicationCookie overrides
                redirect: OnRedirectToAccessDenied
                => 403 (not 302)
            end note
        end
    end

    Controller -> Controller : Extract identity claims:\nUser.FindFirstValue(ClaimTypes.NameIdentifier)\n=> userId for data filtering

    Controller -> DB : Query with userId scope
    DB --> Controller : Results
    Controller --> Pipeline : Response
    Pipeline --> Axios : **200 OK** + data
    Axios --> React : response.data
    React --> User : Rendered page
end

== Phase 5: Token Expiry & Re-authentication ==

User -> React : Later... token has expired
React -> Axios : API call
Axios -> Axios : Interceptor attaches expired token
Axios -> Pipeline : Request with expired Bearer token
Pipeline -> Pipeline : ValidateLifetime fails: token.exp < UtcNow
Pipeline --> Axios : **401 Unauthorized**
Axios --> React : err.response.status = 401
React -> React : Error handler detects 401
React -> React : Redirect to /login?returnUrl={currentPath}
React --> User : Login page shown — "Session expired"

== Phase 6: Logout ==

User -> React : Clicks **"Logout"** in Navbar
React -> React : AuthContext.logout()

group Clear localStorage
    React -> React : localStorage.removeItem("token")
    React -> React : localStorage.removeItem("role")
    React -> React : localStorage.removeItem("username")
end

React -> React : Update AuthContext:\n  isLoggedIn = false, isAdmin = false, username = null

note over React, Axios
    Subsequent API calls will NOT include Authorization header
    (interceptor finds no token). Protected endpoints return 401.
end note

React --> User : Redirect to Home / Login page

@enduml
